  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Vittnesskydd, Lettl</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Witness prot, Latvia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Vitnesskydd i Lettland, Fas 1. M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att vittnen till brott samt brottsoffer skall k&#xe4;nna en st&#xf6;rre s&#xe4;kerhet vid vittnesm&#xe5;l inf&#xf6;r domstol. Denna insats best&#xe5;r av ett tredagarsseminarium samt studiebes&#xf6;k i Sverige f&#xf6;r lettiska polischefer som i sitt dagliga arbete ansvarar f&#xf6;r vittnesskydd. Svensk part &#xe4;r Rikspolisstyrelsen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Witness protection in Latvia. The objective is to develop a higher level of witness- and victim protection. This first project consists of a seminar and a study visit in Sweden for Latvian police officers in leading positions who work with witness protection issues at a daily basis. Swedish counterpart is the National Police Board.</narrative>
  </description>
